        <div class="cf-copy">
          <p class="cf-intro">Hello! I’m a husband, father, and generally curious person living in Pasadena.</p>
          <p class="cf-intro">I’m trying to understand how minds develop—and how we can build environments that help people <a href="/now">learn and flourish</a>.</p>
          <ul class="cf-directory"><li>what I’m doing <a href="/now">now</a></li><li>what I’m <a href="/shelf">reading</a></li><li>all my unfinished <a href="/terrain">notes and questions</a></li></ul>
          <section class="cf-section"><h2>Selected</h2>{selected.map((item) => <article class="cf-feature"><a href={item.href}>{item.title}</a><p>{item.description}</p></article>)}</section>
          <section class="cf-section"><h2>Recently written</h2><ul class="cf-recent">{recent.map((item) => <li><a href={item.href}>{item.title}</a></li>)}</ul></section>
          <p class="cf-note">Everything here is a perpetual draft. <a href="/rss.xml">RSS</a></p>
        </div>
      </div></main>
    )}

